[{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0520","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-14750","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server Console 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle WebLogic Server 控制台（Console）组件存在未授权远程代码执行漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 HTTP 协议访问受影响的 WebLogic 控制台，利用该漏洞无需任何权限即可完全接管目标服务器，获取对机密性、完整性和可用性的完全控制。该漏洞影响 WebLogic Server 10.3.6.0.0、12.1.3.0.0、12.2.1.3.0、12.2.1.4.0 及 14.1.1.0.0 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，且漏洞已被广泛利用。Oracle 已在 2020 年 10 月关键补丁更新（CPU）中修复此漏洞，建议用户立即升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-14750"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-11-02T21:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:55:25Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Oracle 2020 年 10 月关键补丁更新（CPU）对应版本：10.3.6.0.0 升级至 10.3.6.0.190716 以上，12.1.3.0.0 升级至 12.1.3.0.200929 以上，12.2.1.3.0 升级至 12.2.1.3.200929 以上，12.2.1.4.0 升级至 12.2.1.4.200929 以上，14.1.1.0.0 升级至 14.1.1.0.200929 以上。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 前端或 WAF 层面限制对 /console/、/console/css/ 等路径的访问，仅允许可信 IP 访问 WebLogic 管理控制台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160143/Oracle-WebLogic-Server-Administration-Console-Handle-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/alert-cve-2020-14750.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-14750","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-14750.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-14750.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2020-14750.yaml","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/weblogic/CVE-2020-14750.md","https://github.com/al0ne/suricata-rules/blob/ce4569bfe08b6884c9dd29f4bb09b712aeff467c/CVE/CVE-2020-14750/CVE-2020-14750.rules","https://github.com/al0ne/suricata-rules/blob/ce4569bfe08b6884c9dd29f4bb09b712aeff467c/CVE/CVE-2020-14750/README.md","https://github.com/sudohyak/suricata-rules/blob/33928d291812926c07379e895a2075fbfc84b459/CVE-2020-14750/CVE-2020-14750.rules","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2020-14750.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-14750.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-14750/vultarget/README.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/911f59febd1bbb3aa37b38750a1867e7a514757c/2020/CVE-2020-14750/kizz-CVE-2020-14750.sh","https://github.com/0xn0ne/weblogicScanner","https://github.com/pprietosanchez/CVE-2020-14750","https://github.com/NS-Sp4ce/CVE-2020-14882","https://github.com/corelight/CVE-2020-14882-weblogicRCE","https://github.com/kkhacklabs/CVE-2020-14750"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1906","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1906.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-8260","title":"Pulse Secure Pulse Connect Secure 未受控gzip解压远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Pulse Connect Secure 在 9.1R9 及之前版本的管理 Web 界面中存在不安全的 gzip 解压漏洞。已通过身份验证的攻击者可利用该漏洞上传包含恶意文件的特制 gzip 压缩包，在服务器上进行未受控的归档文件解压操作，从而实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响使用受影响版本 Pulse Connect Secure 的远程接入设备，攻击者需要具备有效账户权限才能触发。成功利用后可完全控制设备，导致敏感数据泄露、横向移动及内网渗透。Pulse Secure 官方已在 9.1R9 版本中修复此问题，建议用户尽快升级至安全版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2020-8260"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-10-28T13:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:26:09Z","remediation":"将 Pulse Connect Secure 升级到 9.1R9 或更高版本以修复该漏洞，升级前请先保存系统配置并导出用户配置。升级完成后执行工厂重置（Factory Reset），重新导入配置并重置所有账户密码（包括管理员、服务和用户账户）。同时部署 Pulse Connect Secure Integrity Tool（KB44755）进行文件系统完整性校验，若发现哈希不匹配须立即隔离设备并上报事件。如暂无法升级，可通过导入厂商提供的 XML 配置文件（SA44784）作为临时缓解措施，限制管理员 Web 界面的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160619/Pulse-Secure-VPN-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://kb.pulsesecure.net/articles/Pulse_Security_Advisories/SA44601","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-8260","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-8260.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2020/8xxx/CVE-2020-8260.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-8260.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-8260.md","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/929b6ea1a1a05b6cd00f9afcd22053f36ec0c5dc/modules/exploits/linux/http/pulse_secure_gzip_rce.rb","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-8260.json","https://github.com/OISF/suricata/blob/dde0d7295b647af5ef81e238f0b0dd078cf7b7ee/src/detect-xbits.c","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-8260.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2020-8260.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-8260.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1906.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1500","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1500.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-3580","title":"思科 Adaptive Security Appliance 和 Firepower Threat Defense 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Cisco Adaptive Security Appliance（ASA）和 Firepower Threat Defense（FTD）的 Web 服务接口存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，由于对用户输入缺乏充分验证，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造恶意链接，诱使受影响设备的 Web 服务用户点击，从而在浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本代码或窃取敏感信息。该漏洞仅影响启用了特定 AnyConnect 和 WebVPN 配置的设备，攻击者无需凭据即可在用户浏览器中运行 JavaScript，进而劫持会话、篡改页面内容或获取凭据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2020-3580"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-10-21T19:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:18:38Z","remediation":"升级到修复版本以消除漏洞：Cisco ASA Software 9.8 升级至 9.8.4.34、9.9 升级至 9.9.2.85、9.12 升级至 9.12.4.13、9.13 升级至 9.13.1.21、9.14 升级至 9.14.2.8、9.15 升级至 9.15.1.15；Cisco FTD Software 6.4.0 升级至 6.4.0.12、6.5.0 升级至 6.5.0.5、6.6.0 升级至 6.6.4、6.7.0 升级至 6.7.0.2。ASA 9.7 及更早版本和 9.10 已停止维护，须迁移至受支持的修复版本。FTD 设备通过 FMC 或 FDM 界面完成升级后需重新应用访问控制策略。该漏洞仅影响启用了 AnyConnect IKEv2（含 client-services）或 WebVPN（含 Clientless SSL VPN）的配置，可在设备上执行 show running-config 确认是否存在 crypto ikev2 enable client-services 或 webvpn enable 配置项来判断受影响程度。由于公开利用代码已存在且正被积极利用，建议在边界设备上部署 Snort 规则 57856 和 57857 检测攻击流量。该漏洞无可用缓解措施，升级软件版本是唯一修复方式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-asaftd-xss-multiple-FCB3vPZe","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-3580","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-3580.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3580.md","https://github.com/Bywalks/DarkAngel/blob/c848cc83fe627341cc6d6f4d0997c1b305451263/vconfig/template/CVE-2020-3580.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-3580/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2020-3580.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2020/CVE-2020-3580.py","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f0157eb1d3b7a8fabc66703c974f4c55304d1fa1/2020/3xxx/CVE-2020-3580.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/3e253f079058e6df7e4532d62dad1b8c90d71b6c/2020/CVE-2020-3580.json","https://github.com/CLincat/vulcat/blob/4ac98801f331920dd8c0840b8332164176edcab8/payloads/Cisco/cisco-cve-2020-3580-xss.py","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-3580.md","https://github.com/bugbountywithmarco/bugbounty-disclosed-reports/blob/b6c76d1437e08a0ef77b7fbed612791c71cc4aa5/reports/1243650_-_XSS_-_CVE-2020-3580.md","https://github.com/bugbountywithmarco/bugbounty-disclosed-reports/blob/b6c76d1437e08a0ef77b7fbed612791c71cc4aa5/reports/1277392_XSS_due_to_CVE-2020-3580.md","https://github.com/adarshvs/CVE-2020-3580","https://github.com/Hudi233/CVE-2020-3580","https://github.com/catatonicprime/CVE-2020-3580","https://github.com/cruxN3T/CVE-2020-3580"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1500.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0608","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-14883","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server Console 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle WebLogic Server Console 组件存在远程代码执行漏洞，攻击者可通过向 /console/console.portal 接口发送特制 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞。该漏洞影响 10.3.6.0.0、12.1.3.0.0、12.2.1.3.0、12.2.1.4.0 及 14.1.1.0.0 等多个版本。虽然单独利用需要高权限，但结合 CVE-2020-14882 认证绕过漏洞可实现未授权远程代码执行，攻击者无需任何凭证即可完全接管目标 WebLogic Server，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。Oracle 已在 2020 年 10 月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2020-14883"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-10-21T15:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:55:44Z","remediation":"升级 Oracle WebLogic Server 至 10.3.6.0.0 及以上版本的 2020 年 10 月 CPU 补丁；如无法升级，立即删除 /console/console.portal 接口或通过访问控制列表限制 /console 路径的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160143/Oracle-WebLogic-Server-Administration-Console-Handle-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuoct2020.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-14883","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-14883.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-14883.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/weblogic/CVE-2020-14883.md","https://github.com/helloexp/0day/blob/29bd78f73941b39e36d38cd1653433dcf2ce588e/96-Java专区/WebLogic/CVE-2020-14883 未授权访问/README.MD","https://github.com/xinyisleep/pocscan/blob/ee0c74e68ec95b82a4e4ebcdb961d6ed18a44b77/cve.cnvd/CVE-2020-14883.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/fb895a028d237264136595d395b994d9b352c88c/data/by-cve/CVE-2020-14883.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/35f9b3e8357e0d8772fff063705476aef1eab27f/2020/CVE-2020-14883.json","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/WebLogic_one_GET_request_RCE_分析（CVE-2020-14882+CVE-2020-14883）.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/fb895a028d237264136595d395b994d9b352c88c/data/2020/CVE-2020-14883-B1anda0_CVE-2020-14883.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-14883.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-14883/vultarget/README.md","https://github.com/0xn0ne/weblogicScanner","https://github.com/1n7erface/PocList","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2020-14882","https://github.com/NS-Sp4ce/CVE-2020-14882","https://github.com/murataydemir/CVE-2020-14883"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0606","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-14882","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server Console 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle WebLogic Server 的 Console 组件存在远程代码执行漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 HTTP 协议向受影响的 WebLogic Console 管理控制台发送特制请求，利用该漏洞绕过权限验证并执行任意代码，从而完全接管目标服务器。该漏洞影响 WebLogic Server 10.3.6.0.0、12.1.3.0.0、12.2.1.3.0、12.2.1.4.0 及 14.1.1.0.0 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需任何凭证，仅需网络访问即可触发，实际利用中常结合 CVE-2020-14750 认证绕过漏洞实现更稳定的远程代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-14882"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-10-21T15:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:55:44Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Oracle WebLogic Server 12.2.1.4.0 及以上版本的 2020 年 10 月关键补丁更新（CPU）。若无法升级，在 Web 服务器或防火墙层面限制对 /console/ 路径的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 访问管理控制台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159769/Oracle-WebLogic-Server-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160143/Oracle-WebLogic-Server-Administration-Console-Handle-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161128/Oracle-WebLogic-Server-12.2.1.0-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuoct2020.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-14882","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49479","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-14882.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-14882.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/weblogic/cve-2020-14882_rce.py","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/cve-2020-14882_复现.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/weblogic/CVE-2020-14882.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/Weblogic_未授权命令执行漏洞_(CVE-2020-14882).md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/【公众号文章】bugs/cve-2020-14882 复现.md","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/Weblogic/CVE-2020-14882/README.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/Weblogic_CVE-2020-14882(10.x_12.x)_利用方式.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2020/CVE-2020-14882.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/fb895a028d237264136595d395b994d9b352c88c/data/by-cve/CVE-2020-14882.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub","https://github.com/zhzyker/vulmap","https://github.com/0xn0ne/weblogicScanner","https://github.com/1n7erface/PocList","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2020-14882"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0600","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-14871","title":"Oracle Solaris PAM模块缓冲区溢出漏洞导致远程接管","description":"Oracle Solaris 系统的可插拔认证模块（PAM）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，CWE-787 越界写入。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 SunSSH 服务利用多协议网络访问触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致完全接管目标系统。该漏洞影响 Solaris 10 和 11 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。注意：Solaris 11.1 及更高版本不受影响。ExploitDB 已公开该漏洞的远程 root 利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2020-14871"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-10-21T15:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:55:43Z","remediation":"升级 Oracle Solaris 至 11.1 或更高版本（或 ZFSSA 8.7 或更高版本），这些版本已修复该漏洞。如无法立即升级，可禁用 SunSSH 的 PAM 认证模块作为临时缓解措施，或限制网络访问仅允许可信来源连接 SSH 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159961/SunSSH-Solaris-10-x86-Remote-Root.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160510/Solaris-SunSSH-11.0-x86-libpam-Remote-Root.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160609/Oracle-Solaris-SunSSH-PAM-parse_user_name-Buffer-Overflow.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/163232/Solaris-SunSSH-11.0-Remote-Root.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2021/03/03/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/07/03/3","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuoct2020.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-14871","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/50039","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-14871.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-14871.md","https://github.com/tenable/audit_files/blob/8694c356af5885f65455bc31a960abd8e44468b8/cve-2020-14871/cve-2020-14871.audit","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-14871.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-14871.md","https://github.com/tenable/audit_files/blob/8694c356af5885f65455bc31a960abd8e44468b8/cve-2020-14871/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-14871.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-14871.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2020-14871.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2020/CVE-2020-14871/README.md","https://github.com/hackingyseguridad/ssha","https://github.com/robidev/CVE-2020-14871-Exploit","https://github.com/FromPartsUnknown/EvilSunCheck","https://github.com/FromPartsUnknown/CoreTrawler"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0555","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0555.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-14864","title":"Oracle Business Intelligence Enterprise Edition getPreviewImage 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Oracle Fusion Middleware 的 Oracle Business Intelligence Enterprise Edition 产品 Installation 组件中存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。getPreviewImage 函数在处理 previewFilePath 参数时未对用户输入进行充分过滤和路径校验，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 HTTP 请求构造包含路径遍历序列（如 ../）的恶意参数，读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如 /etc/passwd）。该漏洞影响版本 5.5.0.0.0、12.2.1.3.0 和 12.2.1.4.0，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击无需任何权限和用户交互，利用复杂度低。Oracle 已在 2020 年 10 月关键补丁更新（CPU）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2020-14864"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-10-21T15:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:55:42Z","remediation":"立即应用 Oracle 2020 年 10 月关键补丁更新（CPU Oct 2020），将 Oracle Business Intelligence Enterprise Edition 升级至 12.2.1.4.0 及以上版本（需安装对应 CPU 补丁）。对于 5.5.0.0.0 版本，请升级至受支持版本并应用最新 CPU。临时缓解措施：在 Web 应用防火墙或反向代理层面，拦截对 `/analytics/saw.dll?getPreviewImage` 路径中 `previewFilePath` 参数的目录遍历请求（如包含 `../` 或绝对路径），并限制对 `/analytics/` 路径的未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159748/Oracle-Business-Intelligence-Enterprise-Edition-5.5.0.0.0-12.2.1.3.0-12.2.1.4.0-LFI.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuoct2020.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-14864","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48964","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-14864.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-14864.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2020-14864.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2020-14864-4567.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2020-14864-4564.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2020-14864.yaml","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/BusinessIntelligence/CVE-2020-14864/README.md","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2020-14864.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-14864.md","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2020-14864.js","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-14864.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0555.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1600","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-3992","title":"VMware ESXi OpenSLP 服务释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"` block. I need to provide clean content between `<value>` tags.\n\nLet me write a clean Chinese description ≥50 chars covering principle, impact scope, attack conditions.<value>VMware ESXi 中集成的 OpenSLP 服务存在释放后使用（use-after-free）漏洞，影响 ESXi 7.0（低于 ESXi_7.0.1-0.0.16850804）、6.7（低于 ESXi670-202010401-SG）及 6.5（低于 ESXi650-202010401-SG）等多个版本，也为 CVE-2019-5544 堆覆写问题的后续利用提供了基础。漏洞原理在于 OpenSLP 在解析网络请求时对已释放的内存对象继续执行引用操作，导致内存破坏（CWE-416），攻击者无需身份认证，仅需处于管理网络并能访问 ESXi 主机上开放的 427 端口（SLP 服务），向该服务发送特制的数据包即可触发释放后使用，从而实现远程代码执行，进而完全控制受影响的虚拟化宿主机，危害极大。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 9.8，危害等级严重（CRITICAL），且已被纳入 CISA 已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），属于在野利用的高危漏洞，管理员应尽快应用 VMware 官方提供的对应版本安全补丁进行修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-3992"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-10-20T17:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:19:23Z","remediation":"建议尽快将 VMware ESXi 升级至修复版本：ESXi 7.0 升级到 ESXi_7.0.1-0.0.16850804 及以上，ESXi 6.7 升级到 ESXi670-202010401-SG 及以上，ESXi 6.5 升级到 ESXi650-202010401-SG 及以上。该漏洞因 OpenSLP 服务存在 use-after-free 缺陷，攻击者需通过网络访问 427 端口（SLP 服务）才能触发，故在无法及时打补丁时将受影响设备置于隔离网段，限制非授权访问以降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.vmware.com/security/advisories/VMSA-2020-0023.html","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-20-1377/","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-20-1385/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-3992","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3992.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2020/CVE-2020-3992.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-5544.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-3992.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2021/CVE-2021-21974.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-3992.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-3992.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/8335083e76c9cfd4e73c0d872c60d50f259fda57/2020/CVE-2020-3992/README.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2020/CVE-2020-3992.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/8335083e76c9cfd4e73c0d872c60d50f259fda57/2020/CVE-2020-3992/CVE_2020_3992.py","https://github.com/dgh05t/VMware_ESXI_OpenSLP_PoCs","https://github.com/HynekPetrak/CVE-2019-5544_CVE-2020-3992","https://github.com/ceciliaaii/CVE_2020_3992"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1680","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1680.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-5135","title":"SonicWall SonicOS 防火墙远程缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"标签包裹输出。<value>SonicOS 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向防火墙发送特制恶意请求触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务并可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 SonicOS Gen 6 的 6.5.4.7、6.5.1.12、6.0.5.3 版本、SonicOSv 6.5.4.v 版本以及 Gen 7 的 7.0.0.0 版本。攻击者无需任何凭据且无需用户交互即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-5135"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-10-12T11:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:20:57Z","remediation":"建议立即升级SonicOS到最新版本7.0.0.1或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可临时封禁SonicOS防火墙管理端口（如443、4430等）以阻止远程攻击；同时强化访问控制，仅允许授权管理端连接，并启用SonicOS的入侵防护功能以检测缓冲区溢出攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://psirt.global.sonicwall.com/vuln-detail/SNWLID-2020-0010","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-5135","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-5135.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2020/5xxx/CVE-2020-5135.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/76a9c1d3e08b5513880c6f072ae2e14cd09953e6/2020/5xxx/CVE-2020-5135.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/1b8036f6bf20f17e964eaec9897b470f15ef1f0c/2020/CVE-2020-5135.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-5135.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-5135.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2020/CVE-2020-5135.rules","https://github.com/8lu3sh311/CVE-PoC/blob/0e321f89a2ba216d8a7eb6eb28590d1dc39a74c9/2020/CVE-2020-5135.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-5135.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2020-5135.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1680.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1111","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-26919","title":"NETGEAR JGS516PE 交换机功能级访问控制缺失漏洞","description":"NETGEAR JGS516PE 智能网管交换机存在功能级访问控制缺失漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接访问设备管理接口中的敏感功能，无需任何授权即可执行配置修改、固件升级、系统重启等特权操作，导致设备完全受控。该漏洞影响固件版本低于 2.6.0.43 的所有 JGS516PE 设备，攻击者通过网络即可发起攻击，无需用户交互。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。NETGEAR 已在固件 2.6.0.43 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-26919"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-10-09T07:15:17Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:08:32Z","remediation":"升级 NETGEAR JGS516PE 固件至 2.6.0.43 或更高版本，该版本已修复功能级访问控制缺失问题。在无法立即升级时，将设备管理接口限制在可信内网 IP 范围内，并禁用 Web 远程管理功能以降低被攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://kb.netgear.com/000062334/Security-Advisory-for-Missing-Function-Level-Access-Control-on-JGS516PE-PSV-2020-0377","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-26919","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-26919.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-26919.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2020-26919.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-26919-4928.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-26919/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2020-26919.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/NETGEAR JGS516PE/CVE-2020-26919.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2020/CVE-2020-26919.py","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2020-26919.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-26919.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-26919.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-26919.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1900","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1900.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-8243","title":"Pulse Secure Pulse Connect Secure 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Pulse Connect Secure 和 Pulse Policy Secure 的管理 Web 界面存在代码注入漏洞（CWE-94），影响 9.1R8.2 以下的所有版本。已通过身份认证的攻击者可通过上传自定义模板至管理 Web 界面，触发模板引擎执行任意恶意代码，从而在服务器端获得高权限远程代码执行能力。该漏洞攻击面为网络可达的管理接口，成功利用后可完全控制设备，造成机密性、完整性和可用性均遭破坏。美国 CISA 已证实该漏洞在野被利用并列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），要求联邦机构在 2021 年 4 月 23 日前完成缓解。Pulse Secure 已在 9.1R8.2 版本中修复此问题，受影响用户应尽快升级至最新安全版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2020-8243"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-09-30T18:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:26:07Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pulse Connect Secure 到 9.1R8.2 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，先下载并导入厂商提供的 XML 配置文件（SA44784）作为临时缓解措施，同时每 24 小时运行一次 Pulse Connect Secure Integrity Tool（KB44755）检查文件系统完整性；若工具检测到哈希不匹配，立即隔离设备并联系厂商进行取证分析，恢复出厂设置后重新安装最新版本，并重置所有管理员及服务账户密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://kb.pulsesecure.net/articles/Pulse_Security_Advisories/SA44588","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-8243","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-8243.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2020/8xxx/CVE-2020-8243.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-8243.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-8243.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-8243.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-8243.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-8243.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-8243.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2020-8243.json","https://github.com/tom0li/collection-document/blob/e4915c88f8012a7e6dc7f16f626a1829bccf2b1f/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1900.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1100","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-25223","title":"Sophos SG UTM 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sophos SG UTM 的 WebAdmin 组件存在 OS 命令注入漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备的 WebAdmin 管理界面发送特制请求触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上以 root 权限执行任意命令，完全控制受影响设备。该漏洞影响 Sophos SG UTM v9.705 MR5 之前版本、v9.607 MR7 之前版本及 v9.511 MR11 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Sophos 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-25223"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-09-25T04:23:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:06:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 Sophos SG UTM 至 v9.705 MR5、v9.607 MR7 或 v9.511 MR11 及以上版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙上限制对 WebAdmin 管理界面（默认端口 8044）的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理员 IP 段连接，并禁用公网暴露。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，应优先处置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/164697/Sophos-UTM-WebAdmin-SID-Command-Injection.html","https://community.sophos.com/b/security-blog","https://community.sophos.com/b/security-blog/posts/advisory-resolved-rce-in-sg-utm-webadmin-cve-2020-25223","https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html","https://www.secpod.com/blog/remote-code-execution-in-sophos-utm/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-25223","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-25223.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/15bf95c7b4616c8551a2bd666d40a8a1a07282d6/2020/CVE-2020-25223.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-25223-4870.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-25223-4871.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-25223-4869.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-25223-4868.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-25223/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2020-25223.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2020/CVE-2020-25223.py","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/Sophos/CVE-2020-25223/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4683223ae150496144b181156e51d2b32e6b15f8/2020/25xxx/CVE-2020-25223.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/086426bef313267803353e4e1e756713fe1da650/2020/CVE-2020-25223.json","https://github.com/darrenmartyn/sophucked","https://github.com/maguireja/CVE-2020-25223"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-1100.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-1100.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0019","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-3569","title":"Cisco IOS XR Software IGMP 协议处理内存耗尽漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS XR Software 的距离向量组播路由协议（DVMRP）功能在处理 IGMP 数据包时存在多个资源耗尽漏洞。由于对 IGMP 数据包处理不当，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 IGMP 流量立即导致 IGMP 进程崩溃，或持续消耗设备可用内存最终引发进程崩溃。内存耗尽还可能影响设备上运行的其他进程，包括但不限于内部和外部路由协议，从而导致整个设备不稳定。该漏洞影响 Cisco IOS XR 软件多个版本，攻击者无需任何认证即可在远程发起利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2020-3569"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-09-23T01:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:18:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cisco IOS XR Software 至修复版本并安装对应平台的安全补丁（SMU）：ASR9K-PX 平台升级至 6.1.4/6.2.3/6.3.3/6.4.2/6.5.3/6.6.2/6.6.3，ASR9K-X64 平台升级至 6.1.4/6.2.3/6.4.2/6.6.2/6.6.3/7.0.2/7.1.2/7.1.15，CRS 平台升级至 6.1.4/6.4.2/6.4.3，NCS5500 平台升级至 6.5.2，同时安装对应的 CSCvv60110 或 CSCvv54838 SMU 补丁。如无法立即升级，可临时在接口上配置速率限制器（lpts pifib hardware police flow igmp rate）降低 IGMP 流量速率，或创建 ACL 拒绝 DVMRP 流量（ipv4 access-list deny igmp any any dvmrp）以阻断攻击向量。若已遭受内存耗尽攻击，可通过 process restart igmp 命令重启 IGMP 进程恢复内存。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-iosxr-dvmrp-memexh-dSmpdvfz","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-3569","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3569.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2020/3xxx/CVE-2020-3569.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f0157eb1d3b7a8fabc66703c974f4c55304d1fa1/2020/3xxx/CVE-2020-3569.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-3569.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-3569.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-35693.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-35698.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-3569.json","https://github.com/8lu3sh311/CVE-PoC/blob/0e321f89a2ba216d8a7eb6eb28590d1dc39a74c9/2020/CVE-2020-3569.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2020/CVE-2020-3569.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0010","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0878","title":"Microsoft 浏览器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft 浏览器（Internet Explorer 和 Edge）在处理内存对象访问时存在远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可构造特制网站，通过诱导用户访问触发内存损坏，从而在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。若当前用户拥有管理员权限，攻击者可完全控制受影响的系统，进而安装程序、查看/更改/删除数据或创建新账户。利用该漏洞需要用户交互（如点击恶意链接），且攻击复杂度较高，CVSS 评分 4.2。Microsoft 已通过修改浏览器处理内存对象的方式修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.2,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0878"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-09-11T17:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:46:53Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 9 月安全更新（KB4571687 或对应版本累积更新），可通过 Windows Update 自动获取。该更新修改了浏览器处理内存中对象的方式，从根本上修复此漏洞。对于无法立即打补丁的系统，可配置 IE 增强安全配置（IE ESC）并限制用户仅访问受信任站点作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-0878","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0878","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0878.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2020/0xxx/CVE-2020-0878.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-0878.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-0878.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-0878.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-0878.json","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/8ecb11f7bf4d29e0dd14b6fec922a1303c5fa94b/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2020-0878","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-0878.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-0878.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2020-0878.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1009","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-25213","title":"WordPress wp-file-manager 文件上传远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WordPress File Manager 插件（wp-file-manager）6.9 版本之前存在未经授权的文件上传漏洞。该插件包含一个不安全的 elFinder 连接器示例文件，攻击者可将其重命名为 .php 后缀，从而绕过上传限制，向 wp-content/plugins/wp-file-manager/lib/files/ 目录上传任意 PHP 文件并远程执行代码。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 HTTP 请求利用该漏洞，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。该漏洞在 2020 年 8 月至 9 月期间已被广泛利用于野外攻击。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2020-25213"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-09-09T16:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:06:35Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 的 wp-file-manager 插件升级到 6.9 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用该插件，或删除 wp-content/plugins/wp-file-manager/lib/ 目录下的 elFinder 连接器文件（connector.minimal.php.dist 等），并在服务器层面限制 /wp-content/plugins/wp-file-manager/lib/files/ 目录的 PHP 执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160003/WordPress-File-Manager-6.8-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/171650/WordPress-File-Manager-6.9-Shell-Upload.html","https://github.com/w4fz5uck5/wp-file-manager-0day","https://hotforsecurity.bitdefender.com/blog/wordpress-websites-attacked-via-file-manager-plugin-vulnerability-24048.html","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset/2373068","https://seravo.com/blog/0-day-vulnerability-in-wp-file-manager/","https://wordfence.com/blog/2020/09/700000-wordpress-users-affected-by-zero-day-vulnerability-in-file-manager-plugin/","https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-file-manager/#developers","https://zdnet.com/article/millions-of-wordpress-sites-are-being-probed-attacked-with-recent-plugin-bug/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-25213","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49178","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-25213.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-25213.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/1a583c77a151b9c5f4534bb6fe376ed9456e38c3/2020/CVE-2020-25213.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/CMS漏洞/WordPress File Manager＜6.9 RCE CVE-2020-25213.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-25213-4865.yaml","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/web/wordpress/CVE-2020-25213.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/cms/WordPress-File-Manager＜6.9-RCE-CVE-2020-25213.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-25213/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2020-25213.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2020/CVE-2020-25213.py","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/086426bef313267803353e4e1e756713fe1da650/2020/CVE-2020-25213.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2020-25213.yaml","https://github.com/mansoorr123/wp-file-manager-CVE-2020-25213","https://github.com/Aron-Tn/0day-elFinder-2020","https://github.com/BLY-Coder/Python-exploit-CVE-2020-25213","https://github.com/E1tex/Python-CVE-2020-25213","https://github.com/kakamband/WPKiller"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-1009.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1009.toml"}]